{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_02",
  "title": "偶然",
  "storyCode": "DM-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "71fc0fa345551936ba8599f08e9a59f82d965849a2460707afa64e4cdba41098",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_barracks"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，這些傢伙是上次的——他們怎麼找到這裡的！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趕緊撤退！別磨蹭了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經被包圍了，敵人數量很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就趕緊找一個方向突破！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敵人的斥候已經解決了我們的所有崗哨，敵明我暗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少廢話！難道要站在這裡等著被術師轟死嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你是、你是赫德雷那邊的......你為什麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷呢？他的人呢？他才是負責——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你毀了我的通訊設備！你想做什麼——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真吵啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "負責巡邏的人的確是我喔，這樣才方便在你們的營地周圍設好源石炸藥嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你！赫德雷！你們出賣......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說得這麼難聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們只是要出趟遠門，正好這時候有客人上門，總得有人留下看家嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果給客人留下些甜點，盡到待客之道，也就不至於再被窮追猛打了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "於是，就只好辛苦你們啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你早就該發現敵情，你是故意把我們留在這裡送死——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們就努力掙扎一下吧，拖得越久，我們就能走得越遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——再一次，由衷感謝你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_barracks"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "命令是幫助其他沒來得及逃走的小隊，不過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......為什麼沒有其他人逃出來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們自願留下來殿後了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧，我給他們留下了一點小小的禮物......所以他們會幫我們拖住敵人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我可不覺得這裡會有誰捨己為人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "犧牲他人，優先保全自己的隊伍，無可指摘的判斷，用不著用謊言粉飾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但對上司隱瞞實情就完全是另一回事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你騙不過我的眼睛，W，注意你自己的言行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你嫩得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......銘記在心，伊內絲隊長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟我們還要共處......很長時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——無妨，事情已經發生了，反正到最後都是殊途同歸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許W的決定是對的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你真的這麼想？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們和這處營地裡的任何薩卡茲都沒有一丁點關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們的身份，他們的過往，他們的生和死，都和我們無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真堅決啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先談工作，伊內絲，你和W分頭帶人離開，隨軍信使保持無線電靜默，然後去指定地點會合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我之後會跟上的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不管你們怎麼互相利用，不許直接向對方下手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不直接就行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這倒是挺寬鬆的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不希望這種情況出現，但說實話，我也管不著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但如果想好好活下去，至少現在，就先讓每一個薩卡茲物盡其用吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "赫德雷一直是這樣。\n該想的事情，想得很少，想了也沒用的事情，想得很多。\n......我不否認W是個優秀的戰士，但是她欠缺了太多的東西。\n如果她只不過是一個非常非常善於戰鬥的薩卡茲......\n......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天還沒黑，你就一定要自己生一簇篝火躲在這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你好像很喜歡篝火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但是我並不喜歡被人打擾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的隊伍比預定的會合時間慢了三個小時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那場襲擊，是你和赫德雷規劃好的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你去問赫德雷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不知道這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那就只是偶然。在那裡的雇傭兵都不是什麼省油的燈，招來記恨，理所當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼嘛，我還以為是赫德雷故意暴露位置的呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得應該這麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼不這麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼知道我們不是在騙你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想殺我你們早就動手了，這樣做對各自有什麼好處嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在加入我們之前，你在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，都事到如今了，還要搞入職面試嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷從不追問隊員的過去，但我不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的確和我們不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......想找碴嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過據我所知，伊內絲小姐似乎不太擅長近身搏殺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教你一點吧，想要活得久些，就不要過於依賴你力量的某個部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一個薩卡茲雇傭兵，都帶著刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這我倒是有點意外，我以為那是你的法杖，不過——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——呵，“薩卡茲雇傭兵”？你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是覺得你在白刃戰裡毫無勝算，不過，嗯，的確因為大意被擺了一道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝啦，只是在手臂上留下了一點小劃痕，算是個便宜的教訓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在喜歡裝神弄鬼留後手這點上，你和赫德雷還是挺像的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你才讓我覺得奇怪，像你這麼高調的雇傭兵，基本都死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者說，你能在這麼短的時間裡引起那麼多同行的興趣，在你加入之前我卻從未聽說過你，懷疑是理所當然的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你當時是故意靠近赫德雷的，為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自己說過啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾有很多人想要他的人頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你竟然能坦白得這麼冷靜，那為什麼改變了主意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......感覺這樣更有賺頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要賺到什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不關你事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你動搖了，真有趣，明明隨便找個藉口就能搪塞過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——又是你的源石技藝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是討人厭的眼睛，我的理由與你無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就不好說了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......東面，有什麼在靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不止一支隊伍，但應該只有一支隊伍是真貨。哼，真夠謹慎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，聽上去規模很大，他們雇了多少人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......赫德雷說的沒錯，這場戰鬥比以往都要龐大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面會是我們未曾經歷過的戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怕了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷應該會和本隊一起抵達這裡，讓信使打開無線電。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你敢命令我......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好好，是是是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就繼續守著這篝火吧。我去營地裡看看情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個就是......巴別塔的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，中途修改了一次路線，浪費了一點時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是從這裡向前，工作才算真的開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全員就位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......你那邊呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萬無一失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......從燒灼的草地和整齊開裂的泥土來看，你們兩個似乎沒在這裡閒著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，只是熱身運動，可算不上“直接出手”喔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧。下一次我會在別人發現之前讓你的屍首沉入暗影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重申一遍，我們的任務很簡單，不要讓任何人靠近目標。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把所有可疑的危險杜絕在這片峽谷之外，靠近的人無需警告，直接開火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有什麼疑問嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，目的地是哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能說。護衛任務是分段進行的，路線圖已經分發下去，三天後抵達終點，會有人來交接。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......赫德雷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們運的是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這也是——慢著，伊內絲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用你的法術試探運輸隊伍是違反合約的，不要小看他們，停手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你說他們只是運輸隊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "運輸隊......不，是我先入為主了，這的確是需要保護的運輸隊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他們在運的是......巨大的，這個影子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一艘船？不，是一副......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骨架？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
